      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 4.2 at% Cr to HfZrTiTa0.53 will induce Laves-phase formation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::chunk::000::abstract::41e69f8748"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-modified HfZrTiTa0.53 alloy will contain a fine, reticulated Laves-phase network within a primary BCC matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::chunk::000::abstract::41e69f8748"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Laves-phase precipitates act as obstacles to dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::chunk::000::abstract::41e69f8748"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under high-strain-rate loading, the Laves phase will enhance dynamic strain hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Laves-phase network will redistribute local stresses during dynamic deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed microstructure will delay the onset of adiabatic shear localization.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-modified alloy will sustain a longer interval of uniform plastic deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::chunk::000::abstract::41e69f8748"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-modified alloy will have greater dynamic yield strength than baseline HfZrTiTa0.53.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::chunk::000::abstract::41e69f8748"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-modified alloy will have greater uniform strain before failure than the baseline alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::chunk::000::abstract::41e69f8748"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-modified alloy will exhibit enhanced resistance to shear-band formation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-modified alloy will absorb more impact energy than the baseline alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted benefits apply specifically to adiabatic loading at strain rates of approximately 10^3 s^-1.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The benefits may be less pronounced at lower strain rates or under non-adiabatic conditions.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
